      "username": "dragonlordged",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dragonlordged/{size}/2413_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-06-11T12:14:07.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I don’t remember what we got, but if I recall correctly they were a japanese brand?  Anyways, we’ve got some nice, durable clear sleeves.  They don’t have the disadvantage of being easily ruined like penny sleeves, but they still show off the nice backs of the cards, which I really appreciate.  One thing that was annoying was that they were quite expensive (approx $7/100?).</p>",
